{
  "source_note": "AMD-SUP-2026-02 is Amendment 2 to the Supplier Policy, authored by L. Moreno and effective 1 September 2026. It replaces POL-SUP-003 §4.4 by tightening UN 38.3 battery certificate validity requirements following an incoming test failure in July 2026.",
  "pages": [
    {
